WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The same behavior. Another correction.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Three related corrections converge into one traceable behavior pattern.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
The system proposes a principle: explain impact, risks, and verification before expanding scope.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
But nothing activates on its own. The Owner edits, approves, or defers.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Next time, the Agent presents scope, risks, and a verification plan, then waits.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Turn corrections into the Agent's next behavior. Burn pain. Co-evolve.

